//! The `lighting-color` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines the
//! color of the light source for the `feDiffuseLighting` and `feSpecularLighting` SVG lighting
//! filter primitives within an SVG `filter`. If present, it overrides the element's `lighting-color`
//! attribute.
//!
//! Initial: white. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <color>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/filter-effects-1/#propdef-lighting-color
